  "$commentBonus": "Retention audit RET-02 / ECO-03 (P1-03): after the last tier, every everyPoints task points pay reward (resources only, Keep-scaled, never Jade), at most maxPerSeason times. A full season's bonus (17 x 3,000 of each at scale 1) stays under the free track's own supply (90,000 of each).",
